'' runs before the walk meets the using, 'REC ptr' came back a pointer to nothing, and an
'' instance was built over it -- its methods failed inside std's array.tiko with TKO0808
'' (tiko-editor TE-009). A pointer to no type now declines the instance until it resolves
'' (InstantiateGeneric_, symbols/generic.tiko).
